Abstract = {In the process of urban agglomeration development, space distribution
   and form structure develop ceaselessly. The space patterns of urban
   agglomeration are related to city production, living standards and a
   series of important issues such as developing and reforming rationally.
   In December, 2007, Changsha, Zhuzhou, and Xiangtan have been became one
   Megalopolis of ``two-oriented{''} society. It indicated that our urban
   agglomeration development has entered the new stage. In this paper,
   Changsha-Zhuzhou-Xiangtan Megalopolis was study as an important object.
   The technology of the study is RS and GIS while the basic data are
   multitemporal RS image. Used by the information of multitemporal RS
   image. The space patterns change of the Chang-zhu-tan Megalopolis such
   as spatial framework, Space center and development model was discovered.
   Furthermore, the development tendency of the Megalopolis was analyzed in
