Abstract = {Neighbourhood plays a significant role in peoples' daily lives.
   Nowadays, terraced housing is common in Malaysia, and green areas in the
   neighborhood are not used to their maximum. The aim of the research is
   to quantify the types of green area that are most efficient for cooling
   the environment for thermal comfort and mitigation of Urban Heat Island.
   Spatial and environmental inputs are manipulated for the simulation
   using Geographic Information System (GIS) integrated with computational
   microclimate simulation. The outcome of this research is a climate
   sensitive housing environment model framework on the green area to solve
   the problem of Urban Heat Island.},
