Abstract = {The suction filter method is used to deal with the soy whey residual
   liquids, desalt them with ion exchange resin; the activity of the
   soybean trypsin inhibitor is also detected. Carry out orthogonal
   experiments with acidity, sugar content in the beverage as single
   factor, study the formula of the soy whey beverage gained from treated
   soy whey residual liquids, and gain the optimal formula for the
   beverage. The preprocessing result of raw wastewater indicate that: the
   best result is gained when decolorization and deodorization in 50
   degrees C water with activated charcoal 10\% in volume; the purpose of
   desalt can be achieved via ion-exchange method; the activity of the
   soybean trypsin inhibitor is lower than that of the edible products.},
