   Sol S A; Eurotrans Consulting Ltd; ENVITEC S A; INTERGEO EnvironmTechnol
   Ltd; BAKAKOS S A; APOSTOLAKIS S A ARGO WINE; EPSA S A; Karkanias
   Environm Technol SA},
Abstract = {In this paper the environmental impact assessment regarding air quality,
   for the new landfill site of Thessaloniki, in Mavrorahi, is presented.
   The assessment distinguishes between the construction phase and the
   operation phase, and the CORINAIR methodology is used for the estimation
   of relevant emissions. The dispersion of pollutants is investigated with
   the aid of a Gaussian model. Pollutants studied include the
   ``classic{''} pollutants related to urban areas (like NOx) and also
   pollutants associated with the nature of the site (landfill), like HCl
   and PCDD/F. The assessment results suggest no significant burden
   regarding the quality of the atmospheric environment in the inhabitant
   areas closer to the Mavrorahi site, provided that the pollution
   reduction methodologies proposed will be applied.},
Publisher = {GRAFIMA LOANNIS TSAROUCHIDIS},
Address = {62-68, D GOUNARI, THESSALONIKI 54635, GREECE},
