Abstract = {Kakilima refers to generic informal urban economy such as ambulant
   traders, vendors, and all kinds of permanent establishment of informal
   business in illegal places. The main objective the research is to
   disclose a `virtual map' or space topology of kakilima in the market of
   Kebayoran lama. It focuses on the production and reproduction of space
   of kakilima that seems to be dynamic in terms of various different forms
   of economic engagements and actors involved in space-time - round the
   clock. In this mode, spatial structure manifest in multi-layered or
   dimensions. Findings have shown that production and reproduction of
