   \& Technol Museum},
Abstract = {Resource environmental capacity is an important basis of function
   location for region development. As a kind of resource, environmental
   capacity is the key factor of planning main-functional zones. The paper
   estimates atmospheric environmental capacity of Dalian city. Besides it
   baseds on the analysis of major pollutants statistical data and uses A
   value method. The results show that: Ganjingzi District and Jinzhou
   District are high pollutant emission areas, Lvshunkou District and
   Economic technological development zone are higher pollutant emission
   areas, Zhongshan District, Xigang District, Shahekou District and
   Jinshitan Forest Park are the areas of lower emission. Spatial different
   characteristics and the reasons that atmospheric environmental capacity
   has changed in Dalian City were analyzed, and the countermeasures was
   put forward in the paper, which makes reference to atmospheric
   environmental capacity calculation under the planning of main function
   division.},
