Abstract = {Against the background of rapid development of urbanization in suburbs,
   the local government of Yanqi Town realized that local urbanization and
   sustainable development relies on characteristic regional industries.
   Driven by the tourism industry, local residents flew from the first
   industry to the tertiary industry, and the household incomes increased
   significantly. The infrastructure in the mountain area has improved
   significantly, and the potential capacity of the tourism industry is
   released through the government's old village redevelopment project and
   basin management projects, which can be regarded as the material
   urbanization. The development of the tourism industry will protect and
   improve the environment of the area, and it will appeal residents in
   urban area to live or take a short holiday in suburbs, which can be
   regarded as the demographic urbanization.},
