   Geophys; Chinese Acad Sci; Engn Technol Press},
Abstract = {The subsided land of mining area is not only the land and ecological
   environment damage caused by the exploit of mineral resources but the
   very important land resource to sustainable development of the
   Resource-based cities. A view is put forward that the ecological
   reconstruction of collapsed land of the Resource-based cities should be
   planed based on its zones. Taken the Pingdingshan City as a case, the
   zoning ecological reconstruction plan of the collapsed land was made
   based on location theory, being accord to the urban function zones and
   development planning. The zoning plan will change the spontaneous
   agricultural reclamation to integrity of multi-use and from the single
   benefit of agriculture to the multi-gain of ecology and economy.},
