   sustainable development. The main standpoint of this paper was to
   analyze the citizen's perceptual concepts as a missing link between the
   physical principles of local center and public participation. The
   selected perceptual concepts were territory, legibility, security and
   etc. This paper chose one of the regions of ``Tehran{''} as its case
