Note = {Asia Conference on Geological Research and Environmental Technology
   (GRET), ELECTR NETWORK, OCT 10-11, 2020},
Abstract = {Walking, Taijiquan and other urban sports in Gansu Province is an
   important factor to improve the quality of competitive sports. In this
   paper, the characteristics of parameter system identification of urban
   sports population in Gansu Province are established, and the development
   characteristics of all social strata of urban sports population in Gansu
   Province are investigated by mathematical statistics and MATLAB
   simulation. It provides a reference for the study of urban physical
   exercise population in Gansu Province. The simulation results verify the
   feasibility and effectiveness of the parameter system identification
   method of the urban physical exercise population in Gansu Province,
   which has important application and reference value in the theoretical
   research of scientific research. In order to promote the harmonious
   development of all social strata, we should establish the correct
   orientation of gender value and strengthen the construction of sports
   ecological environment.},
