   DIOXINS-92 ), TAMPERE, FINLAND, AUG 24-28, 1992},
Organization = {INST OCCUPAT HLTH; UNIV TAMPERE},
Abstract = {The ambient air concentration of PCDD/F emitted from municipal waste
   incinerators in the Osaka metropolitan area was assessed by an
   atmospheric dispersion model with real emission data. The PCDD/F
   concentrations measured in soil samples were compared with predictions
   from model and the results correlated. Observations in
   2,3,7,8-substituted congener pattern of soil samples collected from
   different sites indicate consistent composition and somewhat systematic
   changes from the combustion source profile to the depository profile.
   These observations correlated with observations reported in previous
   photolytic transformation studies.},
