Note = {6th Euro-Asian Conference on Corporate Social Responsibility and
   Environmental Management, Freiberg, GERMANY, NOV 23-25, 2010},
Organization = {German Acad Exchange Serv Fdn; IMRE Alumni Network},
Abstract = {Generally speaking, the space planning of for star-rated hotels in
   Harbin is closely related to the urban commercial planning of the Harbin
   city. However, the distribution of space planning is quite different
   between urban centre and suburbs especially for middle and high class
   hotels. The majority of star-rated hotels are located in central areas
   of Harbin city because of the ideal economic environment. While the
   attraction of tourism has not been enhanced a lot and the number of
   tourist arrivals has not been increased, great attention should be paid
   to make invest in hotel construction. Macro strategies must be taken to
   keep balance between different areas within the city in order to achieve
   sustainable development of hotel industry in Harbin city.},
