   Sousse, TUNISIA, OCT 10-13, 2019},
Abstract = {The present article summarizes the experience of application of the
   ultrasonic sounding method for appraisal of the preservation state of
   stone sculptural monuments in the urban environment (Saint-Petersburg).
   Essential information on the internal density inhomogeneities of the
   monument materials has been obtained. With the application of the
