   the monuments under examination (from 5 to 73\%) has been estimated and
   its dependence on the hardness of material and the shape of the object
   has been determined. The use of ultrasonic sounding provides new
   information about the mechanical destruction of the stone material of
   the urban monument.The present article summarizes the experience of
