Abstract = {To investigate mothers' influence on their children's social-emotional
   development, mothers of 57 preschoolers gave information by interview
   and diary about their expression of emotions when in their children's
   presence. An examination of mothers' interview and diary responses
   revealed a coherent picture of these emotions. Moreover, results
